      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I found Green Power Co representatives to be honest and forthright in their dealing with me.  They were also not pushy like reps from some other companies.  Engineer by trade, I had lot of questions for them and they took the time to answer all my questions.They did a fantastic installation with neat workmanship and extras like PVC conduits the length of the DC cables. Their CEC accredited electricians were very professional on the job.  Green Power promptly arranged for the post installation electrical inspection and logging of the paper work for the grid connection.They still have few minor areas for improvement in their clean up and bracket installation.In summary Green Power Co did a very good job and gave me enough information to make an informed choice. Highly recommend them to anyone looking to install a solar PV system.My full review at : http://janakastechblog.blogspot.com.au/2015/06/green-power-co-review.html",
